{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2023-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1696118400, "end_date": 1696809599, "month_true_total": 2609, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:26:18 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "147899019", "author": {"steamid": "76561198129837364", "personaname": "ironfunky", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198129837364/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 18595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 32, "playtime_at_review": 1376, "last_played": 1787790198, "avatar": "e10f8f2de38721e5d6a9b98a28de0c210bdf123b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is a blast with a party. Solo is so so. The game scales to party size very well if your party is in between the 1 and 4 player mark. \nAs for story, well, you're dwarves and you mine minerals. The mining gear upsets the resident alien bugz. Kill the bugz, goof off and drink beer in game with your buddies in the bar.", "timestamp_created": 1696809379, "timestamp_updated": 1696809379, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147898887", "author": {"steamid": "76561198441771103", "personaname": "Lolman1502", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Lolman1502_yesok/", "num_games_owned": 97, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7229, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6636, "last_played": 1729207249, "avatar": "ebb5f22df03499a22682de9005c635364fe5c98e"}, "language": "english", "review": "if i had a nickel for every time i got blown up from the driller's c4 as a scout i would be able to clear everyones debt twice which is weird because the math is exactly that. 10/10 would smash more rocks and stones", "timestamp_created": 1696809163, "timestamp_updated": 1696809163, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147898786", "author": {"steamid": "76561199209908451", "personaname": "FloofdaFluff_NAW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199209908451/", "num_games_owned": 50, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 47902, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1979, "playtime_at_review": 4910, "last_played": 1788062634, "avatar": "6ac2247b585489956fd705cc4df75b4211abb348"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game with no microtransactions, free, actually good and surprisingly generous battle pass (unlike the most common ones), you earn it as you progress. Wonderful, very chaotic but chill random matches, it can still be played Solo and is still great thanks to Bosco. Great Hub design. Mods may need some improvements but they are very simple to install if you know how to mod L4D2. Great environment designs and straight forward missions that are unique to each other. \n\nRock & Stone!", "timestamp_created": 1696808964, "timestamp_updated": 1718562227, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147898625", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018812562", "personaname": "Sparklebuns", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sparklebuns/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 284